e">Prague</a><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Northern Ireland</span><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/south-africa">South Africa</a><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Bangladesh</span><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kerala">Kerala</a><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Charleston Cigar Factory strike</span><a class="tih-tag tih-tag-profile" href="/movement/civil-rights-movement">Civil rights movement</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/march-on-washington">March on Washington</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/selma-to-montgomery-marches">Selma to Montgomery marches</a><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Assassination of Martin Luther King Jr.</span><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Northern Ireland civil rights movement</span><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bangladesh-liberation-war">Bangladesh Liberation War</a><a class="tih-tag tih-tag-profile" href="/movement/velvet-revolution">Velvet Revolution</a></div></section>
